        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-07-28T05:40:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>There's also the case where Ra can easily play a staff and and regain HP, rather than go an entire round without a staff in play.</p><p>Also when it comes down to indestructible, such as Fixed Point. You would be able to have multiple of the same limited cards in play. Thus you can encounter Ra carrying four staves of Ra. Legacy with 3 times the Inspiring Presense. Tachyon wearing three pairs of HUD Goggles and pushing the limits 3 times as much as her body could with stand.&nbsp; Absolute Zero&nbsp;could don 4 Isothermic Transducers and Null-Point Callibration Units.</p>",
